 "info": {
  "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official odb API (2024-08-20). Every other official operation returns HTTP 501 UnknownOperationException. ODB networks and Exadata infrastructures are configuration records that stay PROVISIONING: nothing is provisioned in Oracle Cloud Infrastructure, no OCI identifier, URL, capacity or maintenance run is reported, and customer contacts are stored without being sent to OCI. Marketplace registration and OCI onboarding are not modeled and not required. VM clusters, Autonomous VM clusters, database servers and nodes, peering connections, IAM role association and the shape, version and onboarding status APIs (ListDbSystemShapes, ListGiVersions, ListSystemVersions, GetOciOnboardingStatus) return UnknownOperationException with HTTP 501. Managed service access (S3, Zero-ETL, STS, KMS and their policy documents), cross-Region restore sources and peered CIDR changes are refused. Client subnet CIDRs must parse, avoid the OCI reserved ranges and not overlap the backup subnet. ODB network deletion accepts deleteAssociatedResources because no associated resource exists.",
  "title": "Oracle Database@AWS (simulator catalog)",
  "version": "2024-08-20"
 },
